# each_visit_demo

cast WREN
  .label "Wren"

-- hub

each visit
  first
    WREN
      Morning. New face.
  then
    WREN
      Back already?
  then
    WREN
      Make yourself at home.
  finally
    WREN
      You're practically furniture now.

-> menu

-- menu

WREN
  Stay or go?

  * Stay a moment.
    -> hub
  + Move on.
    -> ending

-- ending

WREN
  Safe travels.
